  "notes": "the pin-knee leader with raglan-routed links (one planform tangent arc per link, one rigid bent bar each: no extra part). bodies: link 1, link 2, member 3 (hub-3 lower plate + E strap), knee link, arm pad (arm-end, on the cuff / BOTTOM). joints: J1-J3 O20 hubs, knee pins a, b parallel to J3 (iglidur pin: GSM sleeve + 2 GTM washers on an integral Ti pin, stk 5; counted as bearing-supported revolutes). Open chain, GH closes it (loop mobility 3, nothing sags). sensed: both knee pins - parallel to J3, they add to the arm's twist (q3' = q3 + phi), so tracking the arm needs them read (or the closure solved with GH known). custom: base, 2 links, member 3, knee link, arm pad, 3 hub shafts, 2 Ti pins (est.); catalogue: 3 x MR117 pair + 2 x (GSM sleeve + 2 GTM washers) (est.). [restored from 4d221f1 / 0bfd60a: the row was rewritten without this key twice (0bfd60a -> 95546c6); checker 2026-10-16: custom_parts 10 -> 11, the 11 made parts listed, as the pin knee]",
